Output public/pages/prompts/ship/scene.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 39ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs pages/prompts/ship"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
# cue: start
Type "/ship"
Sleep 350ms
Enter
Sleep 1900ms
# cue: local
Sleep 4300ms
# cue: push
Sleep 4200ms
# cue: result
Sleep 9900ms
